 "answer_verbatim": "There isn’t one objectively “best” HVAC company for every Houston home, but **Comfort Star** looks like a reasonable place to start: it’s Houston-based, BBB-accredited with an A+ rating, and handles residential AC repair. [BBB profile](https://www.bbb.org/us/tx/houston/profile/air-conditioning-repair/comfort-star-inc-0915-90006701)\n\nFor a second quote, **Air Tech of Houston** is another option; a recent local roundup reports a 4.9-star rating across thousands of reviews. [Company roundup](https://www.bestinhood.com/houston/home-maintenance-and-repair/best-hvac-services-in-houston/)\n\nBefore booking, ask about the diagnostic fee, whether it’s credited toward the repair, and the total price before authorizing work. Ratings and availability can change, so check recent reviews and confirm they serve your ZIP code.",
